"number": 11,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "If in the formula \\(C=\\dfrac{en}{R+nr},\\) \\(n\\) is increased while \\(e,\\) \\(R,\\) and \\(r\\) are kept constant, then \\(C:\\)",
