"number": 29,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "A manufacturer built a machine which will address \\(500\\) envelopes in \\(8\\) minutes. He wishes to build another machine so that when both are operating together they will address \\(500\\) envelopes in \\(2\\) minutes. The equation used to find how many minutes \\(x\\) it would require the second machine to address \\(500\\) envelopes alone is:",
