"question": "Mr. \\(A\\) owns a house worth \\(\\$10{,}000.\\) He sells it to Mr. \\(B\\) at \\(10\\%\\) profit. Mr. \\(B\\) sells the house back to Mr. \\(A\\) at a \\(10\\%\\) loss. Then:",
