"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "In circle \\(O\\) chord \\(\\overline{AB}\\) is produced so that \\(\\overline{BC}\\) equals a radius of the circle. \\(\\overline{CO}\\) is drawn and extended to \\(D.\\) \\(\\overline{AO}\\) is drawn. Which of the following expresses the relationship between angles \\(x\\) and \\(y?\\)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1955_AMC_12_Q44_question_fig1.svg)",
