"question": "Triangle \\(PAB\\) is formed by three tangents to circle \\(O\\) and \\(\\angle APB=40^\\circ;\\) then angle \\(AOB\\) equals:\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1956_AMC_12_Q49_question_fig1.svg)",
