"batch": "NA",
"number": 49,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "The parallel sides of a trapezoid are \\(3\\) and \\(9.\\) The non-parallel sides are \\(4\\) and \\(6.\\) A line parallel to the bases divides the trapezoid into two trapezoids of equal perimeters. The ratio in which each of the non-parallel sides is divided is:\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1957_AMC_12_Q49_question_fig1.svg)",
