"batch": "NA",
"number": 40,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "In triangle \\(ABC,\\) \\(\\overline{BD}\\) is a median. \\(\\overline{CF}\\) intersects \\(\\overline{BD}\\) at \\(E\\) so that \\(BE=ED.\\) Point \\(F\\) is on \\(\\overline{AB}.\\) Then, if \\(BF=5,\\) \\(BA\\) equals:",
