"question": "Chord \\(EF\\) is the perpendicular bisector of chord \\(BC,\\) intersecting it in \\(M.\\) Between \\(B\\) and \\(M\\) point \\(U\\) is taken, and \\(EU\\) extended meets the circle in \\(A.\\) Then, for any selection of \\(U,\\) as described, triangle \\(EUM\\) is similar to triangle:\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1963_AMC_12_Q18_question_fig1.svg)",
