"batch": "NA",
"number": 10,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "If the sum of two numbers is \\(1\\) and their product is \\(1,\\) then the sum of their cubes is, where \\(i=\\sqrt{-1}:\\)",
"questionType": "text",
