"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "Assume that, for a certain school, it is true that\n\n\\(\\mathrm{I}:\\) Some students are not honest.\n\n\\(\\mathrm{II}:\\) All fraternity members are honest.\n\nA necessary conclusion is:",
"questionType": "text",
