"batch": "NA",
"number": 4,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "After simple interest for two months at \\(5\\%\\) per annum was credited, a Boy Scout Troop had a total of \\(\\$255.31\\) in the Council Treasury. The interest credited was a number of dollars plus the following number of cents:",
