"question": "Each of a group of \\(50\\) girls is blonde or brunette and is blue-eyed or brown-eyed. If \\(14\\) are blue-eyed blondes, \\(31\\) are brunettes, and \\(18\\) are brown-eyed, then the number of brown-eyed brunettes is:",
