"number": 6,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "The number of distinct pairs \\((x,y)\\) of real numbers satisfying both of the following equations: \\[ \\begin{aligned} x&=x^2+y^2,\\\\ y&=2xy. \\end{aligned} \\] is",
