"level": "AMC 8",
"batch": "NA",
"number": 17,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "Abby, Bret, Carl, and Dana are seated in a row of four seats numbered \\(1\\) to \\(4.\\) Joe looks at them and says: “Bret is next to Carl.” “Abby is between Bret and Carl.” However, each one of Joe’s statements is false. Bret is actually sitting in seat \\(3.\\) Who is sitting in seat \\(2?\\)",
