"number": 14,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "For any real number \\(a\\) and positive integer \\(k,\\) define \\[ \\binom ak= \\frac{\\begin{gathered} a(a-1)(a-2)\\cdots\\\\ {}\\cdot(a-(k-1)) \\end{gathered}} {\\begin{gathered} k(k-1)(k-2)\\cdots\\\\ {}\\cdot(2)(1) \\end{gathered}}. \\] What is \\[\\binom{-\\frac12}{100}\\div\\binom{\\frac12}{100}\\ ?\\]",
"questionType": "text",
