"number": 7,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "The ratio of \\(w\\) to \\(x\\) is \\(4:3,\\) of \\(y\\) to \\(z\\) is \\(3:2,\\) and of \\(z\\) to \\(x\\) is \\(1:6.\\) What is the ratio of \\(w\\) to \\(y?\\)",
