"question": "The figure shown can be folded into the shape of a cube. In the resulting cube, which of the lettered faces is opposite the face marked \\(x?\\)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1995_AMC_12_Q06_question_fig1.svg)",
"questionType": "mixed",
