"question": "Two parallel chords in a circle have lengths \\(10\\) and \\(14,\\) and the distance between them is \\(6.\\) The chord parallel to these chords and midway between them is of length \\(\\sqrt a,\\) where \\(a\\) is\n\n[Figure 1](figures/1995_AMC_12_Q28_question_fig1.svg)",
