"number": 2,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "Jose is \\(4\\) years younger than Zack. Zack is \\(3\\) years older than Inez. Inez is \\(15\\) years old. How old is Jose?",
"questionType": "text",
"choices": {
"A": "\\(8\\)",
"B": "\\(11\\)",
"C": "\\(14\\)",
"D": "\\(16\\)",
"E": "\\(22\\)"
},
"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "C",
"solution": "Start with Inez's known age. Zack is \\(3\\) years older, so he is \\(15+3=18\\) years old. Jose is \\(4\\) years younger than Zack, so Jose is\n\\[\n18-4=\\boxed{14}\\text{ years old},\n\\]\nchoice \\(\\mathrm{C}\\).",
"solutionSource": "Original Math Practice solution",
