"question": "What is the value of the following expression?\n\n\\[ \\begin{aligned} &1 - 2 - 3 + 4 + 5 - 6 - 7 \\\\ &\\quad {}+ 8 + 9 - 10 - 11 + 12 \\\\ &\\quad {}+ 13 - \\cdots + 1992 \\\\ &\\quad {}+ 1993 - 1994 \\\\ &\\quad {}- 1995 + 1996 \\end{aligned} \\]",
"questionType": "text",
