"question": "A semicircle of diameter \\(1\\) sits at the top of a semicircle of diameter \\(2,\\) as shown. The shaded area inside the smaller semicircle and outside the larger semicircle is called a lune. Determine the area of this lune.\n\n[Figure 1](figures/2003_AMC_12A_Q15_question_fig1.svg)",
