"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "In rectangle \\(ABCD,\\) we have \\(A=(6,-22),\\) \\(B=(2006,178),\\) and \\(D=(8,y)\\) for some integer \\(y.\\) What is the area of rectangle \\(ABCD?\\)",
"questionType": "text",
