"solution": "Both readers read the same \\(760\\) pages, so compare their times for one page first. Bob takes \\(45-30=15\\) more seconds per page than Chandra.\n\nThat same extra time occurs on every page, so Bob's total additional reading time is\n\\[\n760\\cdot15=11{,}400\\text{ seconds}.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(11{,}400\\) seconds, choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
