"question": "Circles centered at \\(A\\) and \\(B\\) each have radius \\(2,\\) as shown. Point \\(O\\) is the midpoint of \\(\\overline{AB},\\) and \\(OA = 2\\sqrt{2}.\\) Segments \\(OC\\) and \\(OD\\) are tangent to the circles centered at \\(A\\) and \\(B,\\) respectively, and \\(\\overline{EF}\\) is a common tangent. What is the area of the shaded region \\(ECODF?\\)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/2007_AMC_10A_Q24_question_fig1.svg)",
