"answer": "D",
"solution": "An average of \\(10\\) hours over \\(6\\) weeks requires a total of \\(6\\cdot10=60\\) hours. Theresa has already worked\n\\[\n8+11+7+12+10=48\n\\]\nhours. The final week must supply the missing \\(60-48=12\\) hours, so the answer is \\(12\\) hours, choice \\(\\mathrm{D}\\).",
