"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "B",
"solution": "Chandler's birthday gifts total \\(50+35+15=100\\) dollars. He therefore needs to earn another \\(500-100=400\\) dollars. Each week supplies \\(16\\) dollars, so the number of weeks needed is\n\\[\n400\\div16=25.\n\\]\nAfter \\(25\\) weeks he has exactly enough, and fewer weeks would give less money. The answer is \\(25\\) weeks, choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
