"answer": "E",
"solution": "The increase in the odometer gives the distance traveled:\n\\[\n1661-1441=220\\text{ miles}.\n\\]\nBarney rode for \\(4+6=10\\) hours altogether. Average speed is total distance divided by total riding time, so his average speed was\n\\[\n\\frac{220}{10}=\\boxed{22}\\text{ miles per hour},\n\\]\nchoice \\(\\text{E}\\).",
