"question": "A dart board is a regular octagon divided into regions as shown. Suppose that a dart thrown at the board is equally likely to land anywhere on the board. What is the probability that the dart lands within the center square?\n\n[Figure 1](figures/2011_AMC_12B_Q12_question_fig1.svg)",
