"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "D",
"solution": "Both the tax and the tip are calculated from the original meal price, so their percentages can be added. Anna pays\n\\[100\\%+10\\%+15\\%=125\\%\\]\nof that price. Since \\(125\\%=1.25\\), the original price is\n\\[27.50\\div1.25=22.\\]\nHer dinner without tax or tip costs \\(\\boxed{\\$22}\\), choice D.",
