"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "In order to estimate the value of \\(x-y\\) where \\(x\\) and \\(y\\) are real numbers with \\(x \\gt y \\gt 0,\\) Xiaoli rounded \\(x\\) up by a small amount, rounded \\(y\\) down by the same amount, and then subtracted her rounded values. Which of the following statements is necessarily correct?",
