"number": 17,
"area": "Unclassified",
"question": "A \\(4\\times4\\times h\\) rectangular box contains a sphere of radius \\(2\\) and eight smaller spheres of radius \\(1.\\) The smaller spheres are each tangent to three sides of the box, and the larger sphere is tangent to each of the smaller spheres. What is \\(h?\\)\n\n[Figure 1](figures/2014_AMC_12A_Q17_question_fig1.svg)",
