"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "B",
"solution": "An average of \\(36\\) pages per day over three days means that Isabella read \\(3\\times36=108\\) pages during those days, even if the daily amounts differed. During the next three days, she read \\(3\\times44=132\\) pages. Adding these amounts and the last day's reading gives\n\\[\n108+132+10=250.\n\\]\nThe book contained \\(250\\) pages, choice \\(\\mathrm{B}\\).",
