"skill": [],
"year": 2022,
"level": "AMC 8",
"batch": "NA",
"number": 5,
"area": "Prealgebra",
"question": "Anna and Bella are celebrating their birthdays together. Five years ago, when Bella turned \\(6\\) years old, she received a newborn kitten as a birthday present. Today the sum of the ages of the two children and the kitten is \\(30\\) years. How many years older than Bella is Anna?",
"questionType": "text",
"choices": {
"A": "\\(1\\)",
"B": "\\(2\\)",
"C": "\\(3\\)",
"D": "\\(4\\)",
"E": "\\(5\\)"
},
"choicesType": "text",
"answer": "C",
"solution": "Five years have passed since Bella's sixth birthday, so Bella is now \\(6+5=11\\) and the kitten is \\(5\\).\n\nTheir combined age is \\(11+5=16\\). Since all three ages add to \\(30\\), Anna is\n\n\\[\n30-16=14.\n\\]\n\nAnna is therefore \\(14-11=\\boxed{3}\\) years older than Bella, choice \\(\\boxed{\\text{C}}\\).",
"solutionSource": "Adapted from MAA official solutions",
"solutionSourceURL": "https://drive.usercontent.google.com/uc?id=1h0XYnHhGAtM4i3JxvGUgozPrlhZiYZQb&export=download",
